  ($pp$Rancho San Antonio Open Space Preserve$pp$, $pp$rancho-san-antonio$pp$, $pp$trail$pp$::public.place_type, $pp$Midpeninsula Regional Open Space District$pp$, 37.338, -122.097, $pp$south_bay$pp$::public.region, $pp$Cupertino$pp$, $pp$no_dogs$pp$::public.dog_status, $pp$Midpen's page for this preserve says dogs are not allowed in the preserve.$pp$, null, $pp$https://www.openspace.org/preserves/rancho-san-antonio$pp$, $pp$verified$pp$::public.verification_status, $pp$2026-11-15$pp$::date, $pp$claude (official page fetch), pending human review; owner chose to show No dogs on 2026-11-15$pp$, $pp$This is the rule on Midpen's preserve page. The preserve adjoins a 293-acre Santa Clara County park that may have its own rules, so follow posted signs.$pp$, 90, $pp$editorial$pp$, '{}'::text[], null, null, null, 120, $pp$2026-11-07T00:00:00.000Z$pp$::timestamptz, $pp$2026-11-15T00:00:00.000Z$pp$::timestamptz),
